          <p>I design and build ambitious digital products where intelligent systems, expressive interfaces and real-world usefulness meet.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button--solid magnetic" href="#work" data-cursor="EXPLORE">Explore the work <span>↓</span></a>
            <a class="button button--ghost magnetic" href="#services" data-cursor="DISCOVER">See how I work <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
