        <div class="hero-chip hero-chip--bottom"><span>06+</span> PRODUCTS IN MOTION</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-scroll reveal"><span>SCROLL TO ENTER THE SYSTEM</span><i></i></div>
      <div class="hero-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">18.5204° N<br/>73.8567° E</div>
    </section>

    <section class="statement section-light" id="statement">
      <div class="section-index reveal"><span>01</span><p>POSITIONING</p></div>
      <h2 class="split-reveal">Not another template.<br/>A portfolio with a <em>pulse.</em></h2>
      <div class="statement-grid reveal">
        <p>I work across strategy, interface and engineering as one continuous craft. The result is clearer thinking, faster iteration and a product that still feels intentional after it ships.</p>
