          <article><b data-count="6">0</b><span>Products built & evolving</span></article>
          <article><b data-count="1">0</b><span>Builder from idea to launch</span></article>
          <article><b data-count="100">0</b><span>Percent hands-on craft</span></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kinetic-strip" aria-hidden="true"><div>AI IMPLEMENTATION · PRODUCT ENGINEERING · INTERACTION DESIGN · AUTOMATION · AI IMPLEMENTATION · PRODUCT ENGINEERING · INTERACTION DESIGN · AUTOMATION ·</div></div>
    </section>


    <section class="cinema" id="cinema">
      <div class="cinema-sticky">
        <div class="cinema-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="cinema-copy">
          <span class="cinema-index">02 / CAPABILITY SIGNAL</span>
          <h2><span>FROM FRICTION</span><span>TO <em>FLOW.</em></span></h2>
          <p>Every scroll step reveals a different layer of the system: people, information, automation and measurable outcomes.</p>
